      "text": "people of Church to be equal, D&C 51:3, 9 (70:14; 78:5; 82:17). order to be everlasting order, D&C 82:20 (104:1). revelation concerning united order, D&C 104. result of breaking covenants of united order, D&C 104:5. United Order of Kirtland segregated temporarily from that of Zion, D&C 104:47–48, 52–53. disposition of property of united order, D&C 104:68. law held in abeyance, D&C 105:2–6, 9–13, 27–37.",
